// ErrorTextRules.kt
// PGPony Android, 4.6.2
//
// The English error messages ErrorText knows how to translate, one rule per
// message, most specific first. Each pattern must match a whole message as the
// code that raises it writes it; (.*?) stands for a part that varies (a
// fingerprint, a count, or a nested message, which is translated in turn).
// Generated from an inventory of the throw sites; keep a rule next to its
// message's wording if that wording changes.

